// One packed 0xRRGGBB color per grid corner: shade by height (../color/
// tiers.id + pack.id), then darken by distance for a cheap fog feel
// (../color/fog.id). gz (the row, 0..39) is recovered from the flat index the
// same way coords.id's corner_z does.

corner_color(int i) {
  int h = (import heights)[i];
  int gz = i / 13;
  int base = height_color(h);
} return int apply_fog(base, gz);
